### Usuario autenticado envía solicitud a TechCorpSolutions
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/enviar/TechCorpSolutions
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### POST - Enviar solicitud a InnovatechDigital
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/enviar/WebMasterAgency
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### GET - Obtener solicitudes pendientes de una organización
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/pendientes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### GET - Obtener solicitudes pendientes de Innovatech
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/pendientes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### GET - Obtener solicitudes pendientes de Innovatech
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/mis-pendientes
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3️⃣ PUT - Aceptar solicitud (Administrador/Coordinador)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/1/aceptar
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### PUT - Aceptar otra solicitud
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/2/aceptar
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### PUT - Aceptar tercera solicitud
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/3/aceptar
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4️⃣ PUT - Rechazar solicitud (Administrador/Coordinador)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/4/rechazar
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### PUT - Rechazar otra solicitud
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/5/rechazar
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### PUT - Rechazar tercera solicitud
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/6/rechazar
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 5️⃣ DELETE - Cancelar solicitud (Usuario solicitante)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/1/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### DELETE - Cancelar otra solicitud
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/2/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### DELETE - Cancelar tercera solicitud
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/solicitud/3/cancelar
